      <description><![CDATA[<p>Air temperature 2m (MODEL analysis, NOT direct observation): <b>LOWEST -60F</b> blue-white &rarr; freezing wall 30-40F &rarr; yellows 70-85F &rarr; <b>HIGHEST+ 150F</b> pink/red. Same F, same color, every source.</p><p><b>Precedence:</b> HRRR valid > RRFS-NA valid > GDPS valid > transparent. Explicit per-pixel validity masks; never blended, never duplicated.<br><b>Provenance:</b> {'hrrr': 'hrrr hrrr.20261011/23 n=698318', 'rrfs_rrfs-na rrfs.20261011/18': 'n=452374', 'rrfs_rrfs-conus rrfs.20261011/18': 'n=0', 'rrfs_rrfs-ak rrfs.20261011/18': 'n=678937', 'gdps': 'GDPS_15km_AirTemp_2m n=381512'}</p>]]></description>
